{"title": "Kerala Floods Submerge Towns, Displace Thousands", "summary": "Heavy rainfall has led to severe flooding in the Kottayam and Pathanamthitta districts of Kerala, submerging towns and forcing thousands to seek shelter. As of the latest reports, 12,063 people are housed in 139 relief camps in Kottayam, while Pathanamthitta accommodates 10,570 people from 3,331 families in 142 relief camps. Businesses have reportedly faced significant setbacks due to the submerged areas. Efforts to clean up and manage the aftermath are underway as floodwaters begin to recede.", "summary_points": ["Heavy rainfall caused flooding in Kottayam and Pathanamthitta districts.", "Towns were submerged, leading to business setbacks.", "12,063 people are in 139 relief camps in Kottayam.", "10,570 people from 3,331 families are in 142 relief camps in Pathanamthitta.", "Clean-up efforts are progressing as floodwaters recede."], "title_hi": "केरल में बाढ़ से कस्बे डूबे, हजारों विस्थापित", "summary_hi": "भारी बारिश के कारण केरल के कोट्टायम और पथानमथिट्टा जिलों में गंभीर बाढ़ आ गई है, जिससे कस्बे डूब गए हैं और हजारों लोगों को सुरक्षित स्थानों पर ले जाना पड़ा है। नवीनतम रिपोर्टों के अनुसार, कोट्टायम में 139 राहत शिविरों में 12,063 लोग रह रहे हैं, जबकि पथानमथिट्टा में 142 राहत शिविरों में 3,331 परिवारों के 10,570 लोगों को ठहराया गया है। जलमग्न इलाकों के कारण व्यवसायों को कथित तौर पर महत्वपूर्ण नुकसान हुआ है। जैसे-जैसे बाढ़ का पानी कम हो रहा है, सफाई और राहत कार्यों के प्रयास जारी हैं।", "summary_points_hi": ["भारी बारिश के कारण कोट्टायम और पथानमथिट्टा जिलों में बाढ़ आ गई।", "कस्बे डूब गए, जिससे व्यवसायों को नुकसान हुआ।", "कोट्टायम में 139 राहत शिविरों में 12,063 लोग हैं।", "पथानमथिट्टा में 142 राहत शिविरों में 3,331 परिवारों के 10,570 लोग हैं।", "बाढ़ का पानी कम होने के साथ सफाई के प्रयास जारी हैं।"], "framing": {"left": ["Highlighted the setback faced by businesses due to submerged towns.", "Detailed the number of people sheltered in relief camps in Kottayam and Pathanamthitta."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["जलमग्न कस्बों के कारण व्यवसायों को हुए नुकसान पर प्रकाश डाला गया।", "कोट्टायम और पथानमथिट्टा में राहत शिविरों में ठहराए गए लोगों की संख्या का विवरण दिया गया।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/8tn8p6/article71313965.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/IMG_80693_5_8_2026_19_34_2_1_SEGBR3EP.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The News Minute", "owner": "The News Minute", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Businesses face setback as flood waters submerge towns in Kottayam, Pathanamthitta"}, {"source": "EastMojo", "owner": "EastMojo", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQV01peFVoMGJNNEJVTGMtQ2RzWGhWak5vSDNQYUQ1c3g0Z1V1RjA2cUF6RmoxNURVXzg1QkFMZmhUZ3lkN1ppQ0YwcDU2NWZiVWhxZDFGLTZXaHZQN01OMUtsMF81UTVmaHlwdFZmNVZkRnNpU3BMenFhWHBDZTdjZjFpOTYxMjM5NXRUSW9VVnUzM3pYa0IzcG80THVaaFFWMGpOeF90bUZXX082bGJWVjlvSjM?oc=5", "headline": "Washed Away, Rebuilt, Repeated: How Assam’s floods exposed Men Kathar’s lifeline"}, {"source": "Deutsche Welle", "owner": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOZ2tCeERYeUtFcnFwQ3V0WG5uM3NCc0c2WUczdE5Nanp1b2lvXzBYdDltelMyZUJRb00xT2pLSjVKUXhUNl9VQi15REVQbEM4U2ZaUG5uVVZCNnppUk01My1pWFhqRmZzTlFnMDFGaVU3ZER1TjBxS0RRSjNYLUxjSkUwcTdjX3lUZEtweVVMVXVUQ1E?oc=5", "headline": "India: Heavy monsoon season claims more than 100 lives"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/clean-up-gathers-pace-as-floodwaters-recede-across-kottayam-pathanamthitta/article71313655.ece", "headline": "Clean-up gathers pace as floodwaters recede across Kottayam, Pathanamthitta"}, {"source": "Amar Ujala", "owner": "Amar Ujala", "lean": "center", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.amarujala.com/india-news/assam-fl